(load "carp-reader.carp")

(Project.config "title" "carp-reader")
(Project.config "docs-directory" "./docs/")
(Project.config "docs-logo" "")
(Project.config "docs-url" "https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-reader")
(Project.config "docs-styling" "../style.css")
(Project.config "docs-prelude" "parses Carp source code.

```
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-reader@0.5.0\")

(match (Reader.parse \"(defn hello [] (println \\\"hi\\\"))\")
  (Result.Success forms)
    (for [i 0 (Array.length &forms)]
      (IO.println &(Form.str (Located.form (Box.peek (Array.unsafe-nth &forms i))))))
  (Result.Error e)
    (IO.errorln &(Parser.format-error &e)))
```

### Modules
- [`Form`](./Form.html) is the AST sumtype and its pretty-printer.
- [`Reader`](./Reader.html) provides strict parsing and lossless editing documents.
- [`ReaderDocument`](./ReaderDocument.html) reports complete, incomplete, or invalid input.
- [`ReaderNode`](./ReaderNode.html) retains source positions and written syntax.")

(save-docs Form
           Reader
           Info
           Located
           ReaderCategory
           ReaderGroup
           ReaderNodeKind
           ReaderNode
           ReaderIssueKind
           ReaderStatus
           ReaderIssue
           ReaderDocument)
(defn main []
  (System.system "cp ./docs/carp-reader_index.html ./docs/index.html"))
